    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden characters with unusual and silly behaviors in a hand-drawn, interactive scene set on a mountain. These kooky characters are cleverly concealed in plain sight among others. Additionally, there are a few mini-games to challenge you and earn credits that will aid in discovering the kooky characters. To complete the game, you also have to find all 100 hiking boots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------/ Game Features /------ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gameplay length = ~30 min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100+ targets to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini games available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different color modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100 Achievements</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden characters with unusual and silly behaviors in a hand-drawn, interactive scene set on a mountain. These kooky characters are cleverly concealed in plain sight among others. Additionally, there are a few mini-games to challenge you and earn credits that will aid in discovering the kooky characters. To complete the game, you also have to find all 100 hiking boots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------/ Game Features /------ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gameplay length = ~30 min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100+ targets to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini games available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different color modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100 Achievements</p>",
